  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Mercy to Amputate her Decaying Leg in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Mrs Mercy to amputate her remaining leg (right), which is decaying as a result of an infection. Mrs Mercy, a poor divorcee with two children, who lost her source of livelihood as a result of her health, is at the emergency unit of Nnamdi Azikiwe University Teaching Hospital Nnewi. Her left leg was amputated last month, as a result of an infection which led to the decaying of the flesh and this has also affected the right one, which also needs to be amputated.</narrative>
  </description>
